sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Web/Mobile
    participant DjangoServer
    participant RegisterSerializer
    participant Custom_User_DB

    User->>Web/Mobile: Register (with or without password)
    Web/Mobile->>DjangoServer: POST /register
    DjangoServer->>RegisterSerializer: create/validate
    alt Valid
        DjangoServer->>Custom_User_DB: create user
        DjangoServer->>Custom_User_DB: hash password? (optional)
        DjangoServer->>Custom_User_DB: generate PIN, send email
    else Invalid
        DjangoServer->>Custom_User_DB: lookup by email/uuid/username
        alt User found
            DjangoServer->>Custom_User_DB: use user
        else Not found
            DjangoServer-->>Web/Mobile: 400 Bad Request
            return
        end
    end
    DjangoServer->>Custom_User_DB: fetch conversations/messages
    DjangoServer-->>Web/Mobile: 201 Created + JWT + user data + conversations